  "name": "Ritual Backlash",
  "description": "<p>Those who deal in magic may find themselves at the mercy of chaos. This oracle can supplement, or replace, the Pay the Price table when resolving the outcome of a failed ritual or other negative interaction with mystical forces. Use this oracle in dramatic moments, or to introduce an unexpected outcome triggered by a match.</p>",
  "formula": "1d100",
  "replacement": true,
  "displayRoll": true,
  "results": [
    {
      "range": [
        1,
        4
      ],
      "text": "Your ritual has the opposite effect.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.501b228f25033b3b",
      "_id": "501b228f25033b3b"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        5,
        8
      ],
      "text": "You are sapped of strength.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.42344c1048209906",
      "_id": "42344c1048209906"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        9,
        12
      ],
      "text": "Your friend, ally, or companion is adversely affected.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.4329e10f1ef94f42",
      "_id": "4329e10f1ef94f42"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        13,
        16
      ],
      "text": "You destroy an important object.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.cfb5247612ddb6b3",
      "_id": "cfb5247612ddb6b3"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        17,
        20
      ],
      "text": "You inadvertently summon a spirit or undead being.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.9bfa2aa1dab3c652",
      "_id": "9bfa2aa1dab3c652"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        21,
        24
      ],
      "text": "You collapse, and drift into a troubled sleep.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.3bda73a14d6ae04a",
      "_id": "3bda73a14d6ae04a"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        25,
        28
      ],
      "text": "You undergo a physical torment which leaves its mark upon you.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.d3a751b087eeac4e",
      "_id": "d3a751b087eeac4e"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        29,
        32
      ],
      "text": "You hear ghostly voices whispering of dark portents.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.4f43b5d0be6ab68a",
      "_id": "4f43b5d0be6ab68a"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        33,
        36
      ],
      "text": "You find yourself in another place without memory of how you got there.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.ca73524d48d540a4",
      "_id": "ca73524d48d540a4"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        37,
        40
      ],
      "text": "You alert someone or something to your presence.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.d19d247d078825af",
      "_id": "d19d247d078825af"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        41,
        44
      ],
      "text": "You are not yourself, and act against a friend, ally, or companion.",
      "_key": "!tables.results!03dc3033749c74e0.75711c6c92353fab",
      "_id": "75711c6c92353fab"
    },
    {
      "range": [
        45,
        48
      ],
      "text": "You affect your surroundings, causing a disturbance or potential harm.",
